  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……円香？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040020,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "え？　ああ……今日の感想ですか",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040030,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "別に……強いて言うなら、\r\nもっと居心地のいい控室がよかったですね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、他のオーディション参加者との共同だったからなあ\r\n狭かったり、騒がしかったり──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040040,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "──空気の話です",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040050,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "手の震えが止まらない子、\r\n何度も深呼吸している子……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040060,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "オーディションが終わった後、\r\n大声で泣き出す子もいましたね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040070,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "失敗した、悔しい、情けないって\r\nまだ結果も出ていないのに",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか\r\n…………円香は…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ……いや、円香なら大丈夫だよな\r\nいつも通りだったもんな……うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040080,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……さすが、難なく正解ということで",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだよな！　じゃあきっと合格する\r\n結果が楽しみだ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040090,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "…………\r\n本当に？",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040100,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "本当にそう思ってます？\r\nそれ、あなたの本心ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（円香の調子は決して悪くなかった）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（だがライバルも強くなってきている\r\n厳しい戦いというのも事実だ──）",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "もちろんだよ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "本心だ……",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "…………",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "強敵揃いだったことは認める\r\nだけど円香も負けてない、勝つと信じてるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040110,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "そうですか",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040120,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "信じるのは勝手ですが、\r\nその期待は背負いませんので",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろん\r\n聞き流してくれて構わない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040130,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040140,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……前に見たアイドル、覚えてますか",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、ショップイベントの……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040150,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "そうです、あの安っぽい笑顔で歌っていた人",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040160,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……今日のオーディションにいました",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……どうだった？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
