    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……すまない。勝負の世界で、\r\n楽しみだなんて安易に言うべきじゃなかったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040200,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "いえ。あなたがどう思っているか聞いただけですから",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……円香自身はどう思っているんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040210,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "私は不合格だと思います\r\nこのあたりが潮時じゃないですか",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……まだわからないさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040220,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "そうですね\r\nまあどんな結果が出ても──",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100104/1021001040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001040230,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "私が泣くことはないですね",
